    "name": "r1-dark-shield-bobboss",
    "description": "⛓⛓⛓ R1-swim D3 — THE DARK SHIELD HITS THE BOBBOSS: FORM 2 GROWS A SWORD. `swim-u5-bobboss-encounter`'s boot, seam (plus `hasDarkShield`) and keys through form 2's dialogue (held index 612), then `up` for 60 ticks into form 2 and `down` for 30. `shieldBump` with the dark shield calls `BobBoss.hit(5, p, 0.5, \"Shield\")` on a boss whose `hitsTimer <= 0`: on form 2 that is `swords++` with every blade re-seeded at 3π/2 + 2π·i/swords, then `super.hit(0, null, …)` — 0.5 dealt, a 30-tick i-frame, no shove, the latch. Hits on t 633 (swords 3) and t 665 (swords 4); the re-seeded blade 0 hits the player on t 635 and t 667. Inside the i-frame the dark shield shoves like the plain one. Fixed keys. Authored by scripts/procgen/plan-seedling-r1-dark-suit.mjs.",
